### Usage in Code
```lua
-- Get configuration values
local enableLifestream = Config.Get("EnableLifestream") == "true"
local teleportationTimeout = tonumber(Config.Get("TeleportationTimeout"))
local maxRetries = tonumber(Config.Get("MaxTeleportationRetries"))

-- Use in teleportation logic
if enableLifestream and HasPlugin("Lifestream") then
    if not TeleportWithRetry(locationName, maxRetries, teleportationTimeout) then
        yield("/echo [Script] Teleportation failed")
        return false
    end
end
```

## Best Practices

### 1. Always Check Plugin Availability
```lua
-- Check if Lifestream is available before use
if not HasPlugin("Lifestream") then
    yield("/echo [Script] Lifestream not available")
    return false
end
```

### 2. Use Timeouts for Teleportation
```lua
-- Always use timeouts for teleportation operations
if not WaitForLifestreamComplete(30) then
    yield("/echo [Script] Teleportation timeout")
    return false
end
```

### 3. Handle Teleportation States
```lua
-- Check teleportation state before starting new teleportation
if IsLifestreamBusy() then
    yield("/echo [Script] Lifestream is already busy")
    return true
end
```

### 4. Verify Zone Changes
```lua
-- Verify zone change after teleportation
local currentZoneId = Svc.ClientState.TerritoryType
if currentZoneId == expectedZoneId then
    yield("/echo [Script] Successfully teleported to correct zone")
end
```

### 5. Use Appropriate Wait Times
```lua
-- Use appropriate wait times for teleportation monitoring
while IPC.Lifestream.IsBusy() do
    yield("/wait 1") -- Longer wait for teleportation
end
```

